; `AX3023` had no positive corpus. Module visibility landed in
; `2192d61` and every one of the 3,358 top-level declarations in
; `stdlib/` and `self_host/` was `pub`, so the feature was exercised
; in its true branch by all of them and in its false branch by none -
; the exact shape that hid three bugs when visibility itself landed.
;
; 151 standard-library names had no consumer outside their own module
; and are private now. `mapFindLoop` takes seven parameters and
; `mapInsertLoop` eleven; they are `Map`'s internals, and until this
; they were permanent public API and permanent residents of the flat
; namespace.
;
; The ablation is the standard library itself: against the previous
; `stdlib/`, this file reports `AX3004` about the arguments instead,
; because the name resolved.
(import Map)

(:: main Int)

(fn (main) (mapFindLoop
  0  0  0  0  0  0  0
))
